{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雑誌GREENGORAの時の〜(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)もう見てくれましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和気あいあいとチョコパンやお菓子など沢山の差し入れを合間に2人でい〜っぱい食べながら撮影したよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は乃木天2の生配信だよ〜見てねー( › ·̮ ‹ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして46時間テレビをまた今回やらせていただきました〜(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかんだあっという間で濃い時間でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1人企画ではたこ焼きの中身をいろいろな食べ物を入れてアレンジしてどれが合うか試したのですが意外にもプリン！！！！美味しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーーーー！！！？って思うかもしれないけど半熟カステラみたいで美味しかったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラオケ企画では和田にかけて和田アキ子さんの歌をやらせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直とてもとても不安でギリギリまでやりきれる自信がなくて不安でいっぱいでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしていいのかわからず、自分の中で沢山考えて悩んで、\nでもメンバーやスタッフさんが背中お押してくれて楽しんで自分なりにやりきりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして黒板アートもとても大変でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもみんなで力を合わせて完成させました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく素敵なのができました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまいまい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業おめでとうなんて言いたくないよ‥。\nまだまだこれからもずっと近くにまいまいを感じてたかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと一緒に活動もしてたいしもっと沢山一緒に笑って素敵な時間過ごしたかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいとは昔寮も一緒で毎日のように\n仕事でも家に帰っても一緒だったからすごく近い存在に感じてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年に卒業発表した時、あと半年あるんだ！まだ沢山思い出作れるなーってなんの実感もなく感じていたけれどこんなにもあっという間にきちゃうんだね‥。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギリギリまで卒業っていう実感はわかなかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブ中にどんどん衣装を着替えて行って自分の場所の衣装の数が減っていくのを見て\nあっもう時間がきてるんだなって思うととっても寂しかった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやにとって、乃木坂にとって、まいまいという存在はすごくすごく大きくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なくてはならない存在でした。\n振り返ってみるとまいまいはやっぱりとっても強かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと一緒に活動できなくなるのは寂しいけど自分の決めた道を信じて頑張っていきますっていうまいまいの言葉にまあやも心の底から応援しようって！まいまい卒業おめでとうって思ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しいけど！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業おめでとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"約5年間！本当に本当にお疲れ様でした\n乃木坂に入っていなければこんなにも素敵なまいまいに出会うことなんてなかったと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもまあやたちの大切な大切な聖母です！\nたくさんの愛をありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっくり休んでね( › ·̮ ‹ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもずっと大切お姉ちゃんがもっともっと幸せになりますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいといくちゃんとあみちゃんと堀ちゃんとまなったんで\nたまこさんのコーナーをライブ中やったんだー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは幼稚園児役をしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4人のショッカーに襲われてまいまいが助けてくれました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかよく仕事で幼稚園やってる気がするなぁ‥"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても恥ずかしかったけどまいまいと素敵な思い出作れてよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は京都"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしみだなっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なに着ようかな〜(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ明後日のラジラーもお楽しみに〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/06/17/3694520/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"}],"source":"archive"}